

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Staff as Staff<br/>POS
  participant BFF as BFF<br/>auth guards
  participant Order as Order<br/>orchestrator
  participant ODB as PostgreSQL<br/>Order DB
  participant Catalog as Catalog<br/>stock owner
  participant CDB as PostgreSQL<br/>Catalog DB
  participant Outbox as Order<br/>outbox relay
  participant Kafka as Kafka<br/>order.confirmed
  participant Kitchen as Kitchen<br/>KDS projection

  Staff->>BFF: Confirm pending order
  BFF->>BFF: Verify JWT, tenant, permission
  BFF->>Order: Verified confirm command
  Order->>ODB: Begin transaction<br/>lock order by tenant

  alt Order already PROCESSING
    ODB-->>Order: Existing order, items, and bill
    Order-->>BFF: Return current state<br/>no Catalog call or new outbox
    BFF-->>Staff: Confirmation already applied
  else Order is PENDING and bill is OPEN
    Order->>ODB: Load order items and bill<br/>under tenant scope
    Order->>Catalog: Deduct stock<br/>reservation key + immutable payload
    Catalog->>CDB: Begin Catalog transaction<br/>claim stock_reservations row FOR UPDATE

    break Reservation key or payload hash conflicts
      CDB--xCatalog: Roll back Catalog transaction
      Catalog-->>Order: Stock operation conflict
      Order->>ODB: Roll back Order transaction
      Order-->>BFF: Structured conflict error
      BFF-->>Staff: Show confirmation error
    end

    alt Active RESERVED version with same key and payload
      CDB-->>Catalog: Stored deduct result and version
      Note over Catalog,CDB: No stock row is changed on replay
      Catalog->>Catalog: Prepare REPLAYED outcome
    else New or RELEASED reservation
      Catalog->>CDB: Lock menu-item rows in deterministic order
      break Item missing or stock insufficient
        CDB--xCatalog: Roll back reservation and stock transaction
        Catalog-->>Order: Structured stock error
        Order->>ODB: Roll back Order transaction
        Order-->>BFF: Stock conflict or validation failure
        BFF-->>Staff: Show stock error
      end
      Catalog->>CDB: Deduct stock and save RESERVED version<br/>in the same Catalog transaction
      CDB-->>Catalog: Commit stock + reservation
      Catalog->>Catalog: Prepare APPLIED outcome
    end

    alt Catalog response reaches Order
      Catalog-->>Order: APPLIED / REPLAYED + reservationVersion
      Order->>ODB: Save PROCESSING, items, version,<br/>and order.confirmed outbox atomically
      alt Order transaction commits
        ODB-->>Order: Commit Order transaction
        Order-->>BFF: Confirmation success
        BFF-->>Staff: Confirmation success
        Outbox->>ODB: Poll committed PENDING outbox row
        Outbox->>Kafka: Publish order.confirmed
        Kafka-->>Kitchen: Consume order.confirmed
        Kitchen->>Kitchen: Create KDS ticket
      else Order persistence or outbox write fails
        ODB--xOrder: Roll back Order transaction
        Order->>Catalog: Release stock as compensation<br/>key + reservationVersion
        Catalog->>CDB: Lock reservation and stock rows
        alt Matching RESERVED version
          Catalog->>CDB: Restore stock and save RELEASED<br/>in one Catalog transaction
          Catalog-->>Order: APPLIED
        else Same version already RELEASED
          Catalog-->>Order: REPLAYED<br/>no second stock restoration
        else Older release version
          Catalog-->>Order: STALE<br/>newer reservation remains unchanged
        end
        Order-->>BFF: Preserve original Order failure
        BFF-->>Staff: Show confirmation failure
      end
    else Catalog commits but TCP response is lost
      Catalog--xOrder: APPLIED response unavailable
      Order->>ODB: Roll back and keep order PENDING
      Note over Staff,Catalog: Recovery requires caller retry with the same key and payload
      Staff->>BFF: Retry confirmation
      BFF->>Order: Retry verified command
      Order->>Catalog: Retry same reservation
      Catalog->>CDB: Lock active reservation
      CDB-->>Catalog: Return stored result and version
      Catalog-->>Order: REPLAYED + reservationVersion
      Order->>ODB: Commit PROCESSING, version, and outbox
      Order-->>BFF: Confirmation success
      BFF-->>Staff: Confirmation success
      Note over Outbox,Kitchen: The committed outbox continues through Kafka to KDS as in the normal path
    end
  else Invalid order or bill state
    Order->>ODB: Roll back Order transaction
    Order-->>BFF: Invalid state response
    BFF-->>Staff: Show validation error
  end

  Note over Order,Catalog: Order never writes Catalog DB directly<br/>Stock mutation and reservation state commit together inside Catalog
